    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ECONOMY CLASS",
      "dinner SEOUL TO SAN FRANCISCO\nindian selection\nlight bites SEOUL TO SAN FRANCISCO\nFancy a snack in between your meals?\nSimply take your pick from our range of delectable snacks\nwhen our cabin crew comes around during snack service.\nappetiser\nKachumber\nIndian tossed vegetable salad\nSandwiches\nmain course\nSavoury sandwich\nVegetarian sandwich\nBhindi dopiyaza, dhingri matter, baghare pulao\nOkra with onion, mushroom and green peas masala, brown rice\nCurd, chutney or pickles\nSnacks\ndessert\nIce cream\nhot beverages\nCoffee - Tea\nRoasted peanuts\nPotato chips\nChocolate bar\nAssorted biscuits\nFruit\nPlease accept our apologies if your choice of meal is not available\nSQ160C SIN-IN-SFO/L/DX/SN1/HBX) 8-2.101-02 EY\nSO /D/1/B)8-2201-025"
    ],
